# BORGHERTZS_WARRING_HANDS (jeuno 44): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job WAR, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 WAR: CastleZvahlBaileys's Treasure Coffer opens to
# FightersCuisses (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +2 (bit 1); CrawlersNest's to
# FightersMask: +4 (bit 2).
lists CastleZvahlBaileys/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade CrawlersNest/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=CastleZvahlBaileys pos=110.041,-20.002,106.811 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsWarringHands accepted
item ZvahlCofferKey
item NestCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ZvahlCofferKey x1 # bit 1 unset: FightersCuisses; [AF]ZilartCoffer 2
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 58.9,0.4,69 CrawlersNest
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer NestCofferKey x1  # bit 2 unset: FightersMask; [AF]ZilartCoffer 6
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
